Sure darts cannot be used till you have completed the mines
and got the luckstone. But once you have completed the
mines you should have at least a stack of 50 darts. If you
even untrap 5 dart traps you will get that many. Not counting
darts found from Kobolds and Gnomes. The only problem
is the poisoned darts, but when you have found several
types of darts and you BUC identified them, you should
be able to determine which are at +0, they are the most
numerous. Then bless them to merge them together.

I should think that collecting 100 unpoisoned +0 darts should
be a possible in almost any game, barring a stingy RNG.
Finding a Wand of Cancellation should give you some more.
In my current game I have just collected about 80 that stack
(ie only the uncursed unpoisoned +0 darts) although I was not
collecting them from the beginning, and have only untrapped
two dart traps on the bottom of the mines. I expect to get
in all about 150, once I have untrapped all known dart traps.

